{"id":"89f48d4d04da27ae","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Well Founded Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree — ZFC Tree8 Well Founded Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree — ZFC Tree8 Well Founded Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree — ZFC Tree8 Well Founded Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in V\">\\(T\\in V\\)</span> (tree of finite sequences, ordered by inclusion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> is the tree-order predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and function application are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S(T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\n\\land\\neg\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(B,\\omega,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(B(n)\\subsetneq B(n+1)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S(T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\n\\land\\neg\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(B,\\omega,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(B(n)\\subsetneq B(n+1)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the inclusion-ordered sequence-tree specialization expected by its downstream rank definitions; strict inclusion prevents constant sequences from witnessing ill-foundedness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S$ is the tree-order predicate (see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ and function application are as in [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], and $\\omega$ is from [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ and function application are as in [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], and $\\omega$ is from [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S(T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\n\\land\\neg\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(B,\\omega,T)\\\\\n&\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(B(n)\\subsetneq B(n+1)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1465,"backlinks":[{"id":"a8c6f5462972908f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree.md]])"},{"id":"9850de813f02aeeb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8WellFoundedTree}_S\\subseteq V$ is from [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3823","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree8-well-founded-tree]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"